{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeBoundedTransposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeBoundedTransposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeBoundedAdditiveJM","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HeckeTranspositionExpansion"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_below","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_below","kind":"theorem","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L228-L251","doc":"`σ_j` commutes with `T_(l,i)` when `j + 1 < l`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_disjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_disjoint","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L203-L226","doc":"**Disjoint transpositions commute**: `σ_j` commutes with `T_(l,i)` for `l < j` and `i > j+1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_base","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L178-L201","doc":"**The hard base case**: `σ_j` commutes with `T_(l,j+2)` for `l < j`.  Braid only, no Hecke. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_far","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_far","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L152-L176","doc":"`σ_m` commutes with `T_(l,i)` when `m > i`.  The bound is on `m`, not `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.sigma_comm_transpB_pair","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L87-L148","doc":"**Pair-swap law**: for `i > j+1`, `σ_j` commutes with `T_(j,i) + T_(j+1,i)`.\n\nThe base case needs the **Hecke** relation at `j+1` as well as the braid relation at `j`; both are\ncovered by `i < n`, since the base sits at `i = j + 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.addJMB_eq_transpB_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.addJMB_eq_transpB_sum","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L65-L83","doc":"**The sum-of-transpositions expansion**: `A_k = d · Σ_{i<k} T_(i,k)`.\n\n**No bound.**  Two recursions and `Finset` algebra — no Hecke, braid or far relation is used. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB_toBelow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB_toBelow","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L56-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB_succ","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L52-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB_self","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L48-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Hecke.transpB","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HeckeBoundedTransposition.lean#L43-L46","doc":"**The transposition `T_(i,k)`** on a bounded presentation, as a conjugate of a generator. ","signatureChunk":0}]}